# Declares that this repo deploys as part of /sprint-ship (Phase 7).
# Each line is one step, run in the order written after the merge and local
# cleanup, so what ships is published from the merged main:
#   `recipe: <name>`  -> run `just <name>`
#   anything else     -> the name of a skill to invoke
#
# BOTH artifacts are declared, unconditionally, because this repo ships two on
# two independent version clocks — the panel and the claude-feed publisher
# bundle (korg WI 2801). Neither line needs a condition: each recipe derives its
# version from its OWN payload and asks the store whether that version is
# already there, so a sprint that touched only one of them makes the other
# answer "nothing to publish" and exit 0. Change detection lives in the
# recipes, not here and not in the skill.
#
# See .claude/skills/deploy-panels/SKILL.md and docs/deploying.md.
deploy-panels
recipe: publish-publisher
